Package: crtmedsim
Type: Package
Title: Reproduce Cluster-Randomized Mediation Simulations
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Simulation Reproduction Project
Maintainer: Package maintenance <package-maintenance@example.org>
Description: Reproduces a fixed simulation design for causal mediation in
    cluster-randomized trials with post-treatment confounding. Provides
    configuration, data generation, replication execution, result aggregation,
    and figure and table generation around a checksum-verified simulation engine.
License: file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.5.0)
Imports: stats, utils, tools
Suggests: SuperLearner, glmnet, ranger, data.table, ggplot2
SystemRequirements: A working R executable for simulation subprocesses

